// construction, and because the field is real:\r
//\r
//   * ridges occlude other ridges, so the range has depth rather than a single\r
//     outline;\r
//   * the normal is analytic, so faces light and shade correctly against the low\r
//     sun;\r
//   * a short second march toward the sun gives the range its own cast shadows,\r
