`,Uc=`// Shadow-pass vertex shader for the terrain.\r
//\r
// Critically, this uses the *camera* position to place the clipmap, not the\r
// light — the geometry rendered into the shadow map must be the identical mesh\r
// the beauty pass draws, or the depths will not correspond and the terrain will\r
// acne against its own silhouette. Only the view-projection differs.\r
