    // and a mountain of snow with the sun behind it *glows* — it does not go to a\r
    // dark silhouette. Without this the range came out as dark warm shapes\r
    // against bright warm haze, which is the one combination that reads as dirt,\r
    // and it was most visible in exactly the framing where a range should look\r
