    // through one seen face-on, and longer near the thick base than at the tip.\r
    // The constant term carries the colour through the middle of the prism; a\r
    // path that only opens up at grazing puts all of the blue on the silhouette,\r
    // where the Fresnel reflection then replaces it with sky.\r
